 :bip/pillars
 {:P-WEB-1
  {:title "Web App: YubiKey recovery-failed Fix & Bundle-Freshness Check"
   :files ["src/bitecho/webauthn.cljc"
           "src/bitecho/browser_main.cljs"
           "src/bitecho/shell/browser.cljc"
           "resources/public/index.html"
           "scripts/build-browser-bundle.sh"]
   :changes
   ["Single recovery path in `recover-from-yubikey` (`webauthn/resolve-yubikey-recovery`) recognizing both top-level `{:public-hex ...}` and nested `{:identity {:public-hex ...}}` redacted shapes without overwriting an already-unlocked `:private-key` with `nil`."
    "Externs-safe `goog.object/get` property accessors in `webauthn.cljc` and `browser_main.cljs` for all native WebAuthn DOM properties (`response`, `userHandle`, `attestationObject`, `clientExtensionResults`, `prf`, `results`, `first`)."
    "Key-format normalization (`webauthn/normalize-recovered-identity`, `webauthn/normalize-spki-pubkey-hex`) normalizing recovered keys to canonical 88-char SPKI `:public-hex` (`302a300506032b6570032100` + 64-char raw hex) and 44-byte SPKI `:public-key`."
    "Cache-busted `/app/bitecho-browser.js?v=0.23.14` script tag and pure `browser/check-browser-bundle-freshness` emitting counted `:stale-browser-bundle` `:diagnose` effects (Rule 5)."]}

  :P-OPS-3
  {:title "Rollout Remediation: Atomic Single-Instance Guard for serve/driver"
   :files ["src/bitecho/shell/light_node.clj"
           "scripts/light-node.sh"]
   :changes
   ["Implement `check-single-instance-lock`, `acquire-serve-lock!`, and `release-serve-lock!` in `bitecho.shell.light-node` using `<state-dir>/serve.lock` and `<state-dir>/control.json`."
    "Fail fast with counted `:duplicate-serve-instance-rejected` `:diagnose` when the lock is held by a live PID, and reclaim stale locks from dead PIDs with `:stale-serve-lock-reclaimed`."]}

  :P-FAUCET-1
  {:title "Hardware-Key Faucet Service (A2: Sponsored Relay / Co-Execution)"
   :files ["services/faucet/core.cljc"]
   :changes
   ["Create standalone pure `.cljc` Sans-IO faucet service engine in `services/faucet/core.cljc` (excluded from validator and light-node `dist/` bundles)."
    "Enforce pre-parse anti-spam gate (16-bit Hashcash PoW + hardware-key challenge signature over `sha256('bitecho-faucet-claim-v1|' + claimant-pubkey + '|' + epoch-bucket)` before CBOR/x5c parsing), server-side FIDO2/WebAuthn attestation root verification (closing `F-BIP7-2`), `[aaguid credential-id]` deduplication (`faucet/claimed-keys.edn`), `1,000,000` ECH `:spend-dac` issuance, `25,000,000` ECH liquid cap with 20% refill alert, and signed audit artifacts for every decision."]}

  :P-FAUCET-2
  {:title "On-Chain :spend-dac Allowance State (A1: Economy-Layer Primitive)"
   :files ["src/bitecho/economy/spend_dac.cljc"]
   :changes
   ["Define sibling `:spend-dac` record `{:dac-id, :type :spend-dac, :issuer, :holder, :cap, :expiry-epoch, :issued-epoch, :spent, :revoked?, :signature}` preserving the settled 2026-11-10 invariant that admission DACs never move money."
    "Implement pure `issue-spend-dac`, `revoke-spend-dac`, `validate-and-apply-spend-dac-debit` (enforcing holder signature, cap, expiry, revocation, and fee-from-allowance with zero dust), `migrate-a2-allowance-to-a1`, and `default-faucet-attestation-roots` (`config/faucet/attestation-roots.edn`)."]}

  :P-NODE-1
  {:title "Node.js Infra Node: dist/bitecho-full-node.cjs & Fail-Closed Runtime-Dispatching Supervisor"
   :files ["src/bitecho/full_node_main.cljs"
           "src/bitecho/deploy/core.cljc"
           "scripts/build-full-node-bundle.sh"]
   :changes
   ["Compile `bitecho.state-machine`, `bitecho.core.protocol.relay`, `bitecho.core.subnet`, `bitecho.core.storage`, `bitecho.governance.core`, `bitecho.deploy.core`, `bitecho.economy.spend-dac`, and `bitecho.fressian` into deterministic `dist/bitecho-full-node.cjs` (`:target :nodejs`, `:optimizations :advanced`)."
    "Verify cross-runtime Fressian state snapshot continuity (`subnet-pointers.fressian`) and `P-DEPLOY-5` audit trail parity between JVM and Node.js infra nodes."
    "Implement fail-closed runtime-binary preflight gate (`deploy/verify-runtime-binary-preflight`, `deploy/build-runtime-dispatch-plan`) requiring Node.js `>= 22` before switching to `:nodejs` and reverting to `:last-known-good-runtime` with counted `:runtime-binary-missing-or-incompatible` `:diagnose` if absent or incompatible."]}}

